    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will receive continuous updates and support. Join our discord server to let us know about any bugs you encounter so that we can improve your experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/fef0a107bff2a0e7e85390405af0ca0e.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sproutkin are often considered the weakest creatures in the land, simple and carefree. Yet one sprout in particular chooses to go on a journey to test its own strength; seeking to defeat the god which threatens to wipe out everything plant life holds dear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/1212bc9bde9696efb65cc92951b75c2a.poster.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/1212bc9bde9696efb65cc92951b75c2a.webm?t=1742781735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/1212bc9bde9696efb65cc92951b75c2a.mp4?t=1742781735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Botanica is a short 2D side-scrolling adventure-platformer that puts you in a world of living plants. Fight and think your way through platforming and puzzles, and test your combat against a variety of enemies and bosses. Utilize the power of seeds that enemies drop to grow and obtain their own abilities, and uncover secrets abundant in this sprawling world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/8c998c6fc585c128fcdfe975c06fd478.poster.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/8c998c6fc585c128fcdfe975c06fd478.webm?t=1742781735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/8c998c6fc585c128fcdfe975c06fd478.mp4?t=1742781735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/edf0cf9444c7ab0ef2d4d9c05875669e.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure platforming with many secrets to discover</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D melee combat and snappy movement. Jump, dash, and climb your way around unique and challenging platforms. Hack and slash or fight from a distance with a variety of different weapon variations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique worlds to explore, each with their own immersive environments and unique platforming challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many bosses and minibosses to fight</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss rush and extra challenges in different game modes after you complete the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary abilities to interact with the world and fight enemies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny and witty dialogue from fun and endearing characters you\u2019ll meet on your journey. Be careful though, as some of them might not be your friends.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting and funny dialogue</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all original soundtrack, with unique compositions for every stage, boss, and event in you encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/1692185d36f51777c3f278135b906450.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/a9c0b971fb3f364a1f8d307e3ddb71fe.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy short classic adventure-platforming mechanics and ability based melee combat in a densely packed package. Botanica is a shorter game, with additional challenges for those who want to explore more. Switch up how you approach combat with seed powers you take from your enemies, and obtain powerful abilities from bosses. Use those abilities to explore the world both forward and backwards in your adventure! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-4 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Stages in 4 Worlds, each with their own secrets to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Bosses and minibosses</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Rush</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 movement abilities, 4 different weapon variations, and a dozen unique abilities to be discovered </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/9a1c849d2ffcf5936e4fd85c8faa5b36.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=131 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will receive continuous updates and support. Join our discord server to let us know about any bugs you encounter so that we can improve your experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/fef0a107bff2a0e7e85390405af0ca0e.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sproutkin are often considered the weakest creatures in the land, simple and carefree. Yet one sprout in particular chooses to go on a journey to test its own strength; seeking to defeat the god which threatens to wipe out everything plant life holds dear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/1212bc9bde9696efb65cc92951b75c2a.poster.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/1212bc9bde9696efb65cc92951b75c2a.webm?t=1742781735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/1212bc9bde9696efb65cc92951b75c2a.mp4?t=1742781735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Botanica is a short 2D side-scrolling adventure-platformer that puts you in a world of living plants. Fight and think your way through platforming and puzzles, and test your combat against a variety of enemies and bosses. Utilize the power of seeds that enemies drop to grow and obtain their own abilities, and uncover secrets abundant in this sprawling world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/8c998c6fc585c128fcdfe975c06fd478.poster.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/8c998c6fc585c128fcdfe975c06fd478.webm?t=1742781735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/8c998c6fc585c128fcdfe975c06fd478.mp4?t=1742781735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/edf0cf9444c7ab0ef2d4d9c05875669e.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure platforming with many secrets to discover</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D melee combat and snappy movement. Jump, dash, and climb your way around unique and challenging platforms. Hack and slash or fight from a distance with a variety of different weapon variations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique worlds to explore, each with their own immersive environments and unique platforming challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many bosses and minibosses to fight</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss rush and extra challenges in different game modes after you complete the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary abilities to interact with the world and fight enemies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny and witty dialogue from fun and endearing characters you\u2019ll meet on your journey. Be careful though, as some of them might not be your friends.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting and funny dialogue</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all original soundtrack, with unique compositions for every stage, boss, and event in you encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/1692185d36f51777c3f278135b906450.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/a9c0b971fb3f364a1f8d307e3ddb71fe.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy short classic adventure-platforming mechanics and ability based melee combat in a densely packed package. Botanica is a shorter game, with additional challenges for those who want to explore more. Switch up how you approach combat with seed powers you take from your enemies, and obtain powerful abilities from bosses. Use those abilities to explore the world both forward and backwards in your adventure! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-4 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Stages in 4 Worlds, each with their own secrets to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Bosses and minibosses</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Rush</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 movement abilities, 4 different weapon variations, and a dozen unique abilities to be discovered </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766200/extras/9a1c849d2ffcf5936e4fd85c8faa5b36.avif?t=1742781735\" width=600 height=131 /></span></p>",
